{"id":"66ba1e952f22cdd1","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-hamilton-perelman.md","title":"Hamilton–Perelman Theorem","display":"thm-hamilton-perelman — Hamilton–Perelman Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hamilton-perelman","aliases":["58-thm-hamilton-perelman"],"display":"thm-hamilton-perelman — Hamilton–Perelman Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-manifold]]","[[58-df-simply-connected]]","[[58-df-diffeomorphism]]","[[58-thm-geometrization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hamilton-perelman"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hamilton-perelman</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hamilton-perelman — Hamilton–Perelman Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"78e4218bb3804257\" href=\"?note=78e4218bb3804257\" title=\"58-df-simply-connected\">58-df-simply-connected</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cb1491fbbaff37d\" href=\"?note=1cb1491fbbaff37d\" title=\"58-df-diffeomorphism\">58-df-diffeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9cca4c00e961ff80\" href=\"?note=9cca4c00e961ff80\" title=\"58-thm-geometrization\">58-thm-geometrization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\">\\((M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> is a closed connected smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span>-manifold</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> is the corresponding typed manifold predicate</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(M,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(M,\\tau)\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"78e4218bb3804257\" href=\"?note=78e4218bb3804257\" title=\"58-df-simply-connected\">58-df-simply-connected</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)\">\\(\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1cb1491fbbaff37d\" href=\"?note=1cb1491fbbaff37d\" title=\"58-df-diffeomorphism\">58-df-diffeomorphism</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}\">\\(\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}\">\\(\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}\\)</span> are the predicates used in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9cca4c00e961ff80\" href=\"?note=9cca4c00e961ff80\" title=\"58-thm-geometrization\">58-thm-geometrization</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\)</span> is the set of Thurston model geometries</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hamilton\\text{-}perelman\\text{-}poincare} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(M,\\tau)\\to\\exists F\\;\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hamilton\\text{-}perelman\\text{-}poincare} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(M,\\tau)\\to\\exists F\\;\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hamilton\\text{-}perelman\\text{-}geometrization}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal T\\;\\exists\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}(M,\\mathcal T,\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{90pt}\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\;\n\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}(N_i,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hamilton\\text{-}perelman\\text{-}geometrization}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal T\\;\\exists\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}(M,\\mathcal T,\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{90pt}\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\;\n\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}(N_i,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusions are stated intrinsically.  Ricci flow with surgery is the proof mechanism and is not inserted as an extra, undefined premise of the Poincaré conclusion.</li>\n<li>Perelman (2003): proof of Poincaré conjecture via Ricci flow.</li>\n<li>Surgery at singular times removes neck pinches.</li>\n<li>Geometrization decomposes a closed orientable 3-manifold into prime and JSJ pieces carrying the appropriate model geometries; it does not assert one geometry for the undecomposed manifold.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-simply-connected","status":"resolved","id":"78e4218bb3804257","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-simply-connected]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-diffeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1cb1491fbbaff37d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-diffeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-geometrization","status":"resolved","id":"9cca4c00e961ff80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-geometrization]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-simply-connected","status":"resolved","id":"78e4218bb3804257","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(M,\\tau)$ is the predicate from [[58-df-simply-connected]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-diffeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1cb1491fbbaff37d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)$ is the predicate from [[58-df-diffeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-geometrization","status":"resolved","id":"9cca4c00e961ff80","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S$, $\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}$, and $\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}$ are the predicates used in [[58-thm-geometrization]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(M,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hamilton\\text{-}perelman\\text{-}poincare} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedConnectedSmooth3Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(M,\\tau)\\to\\exists F\\;\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hamilton\\text{-}perelman\\text{-}geometrization}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S(M)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal T\\;\\exists\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i<n}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}(M,\\mathcal T,\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i<n})\\\\\n&\\hspace{90pt}\\land\\forall i<n\\;\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\;\n\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}(N_i,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2489,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-hamilton-perelman.md|58-thm-hamilton-perelman]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["0e800aa519680c23","78e4218bb3804257","1cb1491fbbaff37d","9cca4c00e961ff80"]}